#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Voice agent demo"
msgstr "Ovozli agent demosi"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Live demo"
msgstr "Jonli demo"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Talk to my <span class=\"serif-i\">voice</span> agent."
msgstr "Mani <span class=\"serif-i\">ovozli</span> agentim bilan gaplashib ko'ring."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "It listens, answers out loud and stops the moment you interrupt. Every answer shows how fast it came."
msgstr "U eshitadi, ovoz chiqarib javob beradi, gapini bo'lsangiz darrov jim bo'ladi. Har javob qancha tez kelgani ko'rinib turadi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Press Start call and say hello"
msgstr "«Qo'ng'iroqni boshlash»ni bosing-da, salom bering"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Start call"
msgstr "Qo'ng'iroqni boshlash"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Who is talking, over the last 10 seconds"
msgstr "Oxirgi 10 soniyada kim gapirdi"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Transcript"
msgstr "Suhbat matni"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "What you and the agent say shows up here."
msgstr "Siz bilan agent aytganla shu yerda chiqadi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Response time per turn"
msgstr "Har javob tezligi"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Turn"
msgstr "Navbat"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Jami"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Turn detector"
msgstr "Navbat detektori"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Each answer adds a row: from the end of your speech to the agent's first sound."
msgstr "Har javob bitta qator qo'shadi: gapingiz bitgan paytdan agentni birinchi tovushigacha."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Qanday ishlaydi"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "The hard parts, <span class=\"serif-i\">measured</span>."
msgstr "Qiyin joylari <span class=\"serif-i\">o'lchab</span> ko'rsatilgan."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Streaming"
msgstr "Oqim"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Barge-in"
msgstr "Gapni bo'lish"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Response time"
msgstr "Javob tezligi"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Your microphone streams to a Python server over a WebSocket in 20 ms frames, and the reply streams back the same way."
msgstr "Mikrofoningiz Python serverga WebSocket orqali 20 ms lik bo'laklada oqib boradi, javob ham shunday qaytadi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
msgid "Talk over the agent and it goes quiet at once. It also forgets the part of its answer you didn't hear."
msgstr "Agent gapirib turganda gapirsangiz, darrov jim bo'ladi. Javobini siz eshitmagan qismini unutadi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
#, python-format
msgid "Measured on the server, from the last moment of your speech to the first byte of the agent's audio. %(pause)s ms of it is the silence the turn detector waits for before it decides you are done."
msgstr "Serverda o'lchanadi: gapingizni oxirgi lahzasidan agent ovozini birinchi baytigacha. Shundan %(pause)s ms navbat detektori gapingiz bitganini bilish uchun kutadigan jimlik."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/voice_agent_demo.html
#, python-format
msgid "Speech model: OpenAI gpt-realtime-2.1-mini. One call lasts up to %(minutes)s minutes. Use headphones so the agent doesn't hear itself."
msgstr "Nutq modeli: OpenAI gpt-realtime-2.1-mini. Bitta qo'ng'iroq %(minutes)s daqiqagacha. Agent o'zini eshitmasin desangiz, quloqchin taqing."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "A live real-time voice agent: talk to it in your browser, interrupt it at any moment and see how fast every answer arrives."
msgstr "Jonli ovozli agent: brauzerda u bilan gaplashing, xohlagan payt gapini bo'ling, har javob qancha tez kelganini ko'ring."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Ulanyapti…"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Listening"
msgstr "Eshityapti"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "You're talking"
msgstr "Siz gapiryapsiz"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Thinking"
msgstr "O'ylayapti"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Agent is talking"
msgstr "Agent gapiryapti"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Agent stopped for you"
msgstr "Agent sizga yo'l berdi"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Call ended"
msgstr "Qo'ng'iroq bitdi"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "End call"
msgstr "Qo'ng'iroqni tugatish"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Agent"
msgstr "Agent"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Start a call to see who has the floor"
msgstr "Kim gapiryapti, ko'rish uchun qo'ng'iroqni boshlang"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "cut"
msgstr "kesildi"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Median"
msgstr "Mediana"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "You cut in after {s} s. The agent went quiet {ms} ms after you started talking."
msgstr "Siz {s} soniyadan keyin gapni bo'ldingiz. Agent siz gapira boshlaganizdan {ms} ms o'tib jim bo'ldi."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Microphone access is blocked. Allow it in the address bar, then press Start call again."
msgstr "Mikrofonga ruxsat yo'q. Manzil satrida ruxsat bering-da, «Qo'ng'iroqni boshlash»ni qayta bosing."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "The connection closed. Press Start call to try again."
msgstr "Aloqa uzildi. Qayta urinib ko'rish uchun «Qo'ng'iroqni boshlash»ni bosing."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "This page has expired. Reload it and try again."
msgstr "Sahifa eskiribdi. Yangilang-da, qayta urinib ko'ring."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Two calls are already running. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Hozir ikkita qo'ng'iroq ketyapti. Birozdan keyin urinib ko'ring."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "You've used today's calls for this demo. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "Bugungi qo'ng'iroqlaringiz bitdi. Ertaga gal."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "The demo has used up today's minutes. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "Demo bugungi daqiqalarini sarflab bo'ldi. Ertaga gal."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "That was the {min}-minute limit for one call. Press Start call for another one."
msgstr "Bitta qo'ng'iroqqa {min} daqiqa beriladi, vaqt bitdi. Yana gaplashamiz desangiz, «Qo'ng'iroqni boshlash»ni bosing."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "The voice service isn't available right now. Try again later."
msgstr "Ovoz xizmati hozir ishlamayapti. Keyinroq urinib ko'ring."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/base.html
msgid "My Services"
msgstr "Mening servislarim"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_index.html
msgid "Open source"
msgstr "Ochiq kod"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_index.html
msgid "Apps I build and <span class=\"serif-i\">share</span>."
msgstr "Man yasap, <span class=\"serif-i\">ulashgan</span> ilovalar."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_index.html
msgid ""
"Free, open-source tools. Each one shows live figures from the people who "
"chose to share anonymous statistics."
msgstr ""
"Bepul, ochiq kodli asboblar. Har biri anonim statistika ulashishga rozi "
"bo'lganlardan kelgan jonli raqamlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_index.html
msgid ""
"A real-time interpreter for calls on macOS and Windows: you speak your "
"language, the other side hears theirs in a voice you choose, and their "
"answers come back to you in yours. Any two of 90 languages."
msgstr ""
"macOS va Windows uchun qo'ng'iroqlarda jonli tarjimon: siz o'z tilingizda "
"gapirasiz, u tomon o'z tilida, siz tanlagan ovozda eshitadi, javobi sizga "
"o'z tilingizda qaytadi. 90 tildan xohlagan ikkitasi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_index.html
msgid "Live figures"
msgstr "Jonli raqamlar"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid ""
"Open-source apps I build and maintain, with live, anonymous usage figures: "
"how many people use them and how fast they work."
msgstr ""
"Man yasab, qarab turgan ochiq kodli ilovalar va ularning jonli, anonim "
"raqamlari: nechta odam ishlatadi, qancha tez ishlaydi."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid ""
"LiveBridge, a real-time call interpreter for macOS and Windows in 90 "
"languages: installs, translation speed and quality from anonymous opt-in "
"statistics."
msgstr ""
"LiveBridge — 90 tilda qo'ng'iroqni jonli tarjima qiladigan macOS va Windows "
"ilova: o'rnatishlar, tarjima tezligi va sifati, anonim statistikadan."

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Uzbek"
msgstr "O'zbekcha"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "English"
msgstr "Inglizcha"

#: presentation/web/views.py
msgid "Russian"
msgstr "Ruscha"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "LiveBridge in numbers"
msgstr "LiveBridge raqamlarda"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "LiveBridge, <span class=\"serif-i\">in numbers</span>."
msgstr "LiveBridge <span class=\"serif-i\">raqamlarda</span>."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid ""
"An app for macOS and Windows that interprets a call between any two of 90 "
"languages as it happens. These figures come only from people who switched "
"on anonymous statistics."
msgstr ""
"90 tildan xohlagan ikkitasi o'rtasida qo'ng'iroqni shu zahoti tarjima "
"qiladigan macOS va Windows ilova. Bu raqamlar faqat anonim statistikani "
"yoqqanlardan keladi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "Source code on GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub'dagi kodi"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "No figures yet"
msgstr "Hali raqam yo'q"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid ""
"Nobody has shared statistics yet. As soon as the first installs send their "
"numbers, they appear here."
msgstr ""
"Hali hech kim statistika ulashmadi. Birinchi o'rnatishlar raqamini yuborishi "
"bilan shu yerda chiqadi."

