msgid "Last updated"
msgstr "Oxirgi yangilanish"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Maxfiylik"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "What the app <span class=\"serif-i\">sends</span>"
msgstr "Ilova nima <span class=\"serif-i\">yuboradi</span>"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "Only if you agree"
msgstr "Faqat rozi bo'lsangiz"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid ""
"Statistics are off until you switch on “Share anonymous statistics” in the "
"app. You can switch it off at any time."
msgstr ""
"Ilovada «Anonim statistikani ulashish»ni yoqmaguncha statistika o'chiq "
"turadi. Xohlagan payt o'chirib qo'yasiz."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "Numbers only"
msgstr "Faqat raqamlar"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid ""
"Timings, counts, error codes and your ratings. Never what was said, never "
"audio, never device names or keys."
msgstr ""
"Vaqtlar, sonlar, xato kodlari va sizning baholaringiz. Nima gapirilgani ham, "
"ovoz ham, qurilma nomi yo kalitlar ham hech qachon ketmaydi."

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid "A random id"
msgstr "Tasodifiy raqam"

#: presentation/web/templates/web/services_livebridge.html
msgid ""
"Each install is a random number made by the app, not tied to your computer, "
"account or network. Addresses are not stored with the statistics, and raw "
"records are deleted after 180 days."
msgstr ""
"Har o'rnatish — ilovaning o'zi o'ylab topgan tasodifiy raqam, "
"kompyuteringizga, akkauntingizga yo tarmog'ingizga bog'liq emas. Manzillar "
"statistika bilan birga saqlanmaydi, xom yozuvlar 180 kundan keyin o'chadi."

